Seer Cliff Vandertrip of the Order of the Everchain is a human over ten feet tall, in black power armor trimmed in gold and stamped with the Scale's insignia, a great axe at his side and old scars across his face. He was made to be the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]]'s warrior, and thinks of little besides the work.

He carries an Everlight crystal that lights the ground around him and lends a holy edge to the weapons of those who fight beside him. Fiends wither in the light of his aura, and his allies strike harder while they stand in it. He calls his companions brother.

Cliff is a high-ranking delving specialist of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], sent with three others to a Joker World at [[Geography/Star 221,325|Star 221,325]].

He tends his companions' injuries after a fight and keeps a written record of their delve in a notebook, so that the work is known if they do not come back.

He swore to the [[Org/The Scale/Voice of Many|Voice of Many]] in [[Sigzil Haight]]'s demesne that he would protect it or die trying, and helped free it. His notes on that delve went to the Scale's headquarters, including what the delvers learned of [[Flintlock Toboggan]].
